 without changing these regional fitters or their posterior objects.
+
+## Dense marker-space sampling
+
+Prepared dense regions reuse the public gbayes dense cross-product sampler
+for BayesC/BayesR. This avoids full eigendecomposition when the supplied LD
+is positive definite. Eigen-based preparation remains available with explicit
+retention controls. These routes share model ownership, but their update
+operators can have different floating-point and RNG behavior; timings alone
+do not establish posterior equivalence or convergence.
